    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-07: `Route::apiResource()` explicitly excludes `GET /create` and `GET /{id}/edit` (HTML form routes), but hypergumbo emits them anyway, treating `apiResource()` identically to `resource()`. The `.except()` modifier is also silently ignored. On koel: 40 phantom routes (19.3% of 207 reported). Fix in the Laravel route-extraction logic — distinguish `apiResource` from `resource` and parse `.except()`/`.only()` modifiers."  # 8774
